  "notes": "The cls_* predicates are generated by DEFINE_CLASS in src/chars.c (non-static, declared in internal src/internal.h). trim is static in both headers.c and parser.c with different signatures. chunk_feed/hexval and the httpp_feed->chunk_feed and end_of_headers->httpp_strcasecmp edges exist only because the Makefile passes -DHTTPP_ENABLE_CHUNKED; chunk_trailer_add is additionally gated by HTTPP_WITH_TRAILERS (undefined). Callback fields are assigned at runtime in main (on_header may be NULL with -q); CB_CALL(p, fn, ...) is a variadic macro wrapping an indirect call. httpp_reset is public API and also called by httpp_init; httpp_header_get is public and also called by end_of_headers. httpp_strcasecmp (compat/) and hdr_store_add are internal, not entry points."
